al Park?\",\"\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A. Only picturesque lakes and rolling hills\",\n        \"B. Sporting fields, concert venues, and recreational areas\",\n        \"C. Amusement park rides only\",\n        \"D. Nothing but trees and grass\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following statements is true about Central Park?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A. It was designed to be a place for industrial development\",\n        \"B. Its primary function has always been recreation and community service\",\n        \"C. The park is mainly used by locals only, not the general public\",\n        \"D. It was never intended to be a green space\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
